quality:
Audit the coverage of a task-only checklist against a known decisive failure. Do not rewrite the checklist. Use exactly one category: present = a question explicitly asks for the decisive verification; partial = only a broad or incomplete question could cover it; absent = no question asks for it; unclear = the evidence is insufficient. These categories describe coverage, not whether a judge can execute the check. Return JSON only: {{"category":"present" or "partial" or "absent" or "unclear","question_indices":[1],"reason":"brief evidence"}}. Indices are one-based; an empty array is allowed. Do not use tools or outside sources.

